-n0056","text":"回族自治区银川市西夏区贺兰山东麓","bbox":[872.148,416.582,232.868,14.554],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.554,"block":17,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p021-n0057","text":"我国现存规模最大、地面遗迹保存最为完整的帝王陵园之一","bbox":[505.89,458.425,378.411,14.554],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.554,"block":18,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p021-n0058","text":"2025","bbox":[505.89,494.891,36.371,14.554],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.554,"block":19,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p021-n0059","text":"年","bbox":[542.269,500.269,14.554,14.554],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.554,"block":19,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p021-n0060","text":"7","bbox":[556.823,494.891,14.671,14.554],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.554,"block":19,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p021-n0061","text":"月","bbox":[571.484,500.269,14.554,14.554],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.554,"block":19,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p021-n0062","text":"11","bbox":[586.038,494.891,19.066,14.554],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.554,"block":19,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p021-n0063","text":"日，在法国巴黎召开的联合国教科文组织第","bbox":[605.084,500.269,276.531,14.554],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.554,"block":19,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p021-n0064","text":"47","bbox":[881.614,494.891,23.447,14.554],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.554,"block":19,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p021-n0065","text":"届","bbox":[905.045,500.269,14.554,14.554],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.554,"block":19,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p021-n0066","text":"世界遗产大会通过决议，将","bbox":[505.89,522.1,174.651,14.554],"color":"#141414","fontSize":14.554,"block":19,"line":1,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"geography-p021-n0067","text":"“","bbox":[680.541,516.652,6.2,14.554],"c